# Normalize line endings across platforms. Text files are stored LF in git
# and checked out LF everywhere, regardless of each machine's core.autocrlf
# setting. This keeps shell hooks, scripts, and diffs deterministic on both
# Linux/macOS and Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.tif   binary
*.tiff  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary
